 ## Weekly P/E perspective and range bar — 2026-10-09
 
 - **Scope:** Every stored weekly price becomes one P/E row. Use the latest annual basic/diluted EPS with fiscal end <= price date, carry it forward without interpolation, and leave gaps for non-positive/missing EPS. Before first annual fiscal end, EPS and P/E are unavailable. This is retrospective, not a filing-date backtest, TTM or forward P/E. Split-only positive price is preferred per observation; adjusted fallback is approximate.
